=Create a personalized email to reengage a highly inactive client with the following details:

Client Name: {{$node["Code - Process High Inactivity"].json["firstName"]}} {{$node["Code - Process High Inactivity"].json["lastName"]}}
Coaching Type: {{$node["Code - Process High Inactivity"].json["coachingType"]}}
Total Sessions: {{$node["Code - Process High Inactivity"].json["sessionCount"]}}
Days Since Last Session: {{$node["Code - Process High Inactivity"].json["daysSinceLastSession"]}}

The email should:
1. Be warm and non-judgmental
2. Express genuine concern for their progress
3. Acknowledge the gap in coaching
4. Offer a special "welcome back" session at a discounted rate
5. Include a clear call-to-action to schedule a session
6. Be written in a conversational, personal tone

The email should be formatted in HTML for a Gmail message.

