Total Sessions: {{$node["Code - Process Medium Inactivity"].json["sessionCount"]}}
Days Since Last Session: {{$node["Code - Process Medium Inactivity"].json["daysSinceLastSession"]}}

The email should:
1. Be warm and encouraging
2. Remind them of their progress and goals
3. Suggest picking up where they left off
4. Offer a convenient scheduling option
5. Include a clear call-to-action
6. Be written in a conversational, personal tone

The email should be formatted in HTML for a Gmail message.

